{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_030_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:dbb722d3847b9d4c6fab7401f3d3d601767de25142ccbaa0cd05ba733f97a1b2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b820f398942ddf15b8296e670185396dc59cdb7201c202fbb4b03f4502581639",
      "text": "哇啊……！这个是情人节巧克力对吧？\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:699ba99ae965e8e82529cd7fef9ded6725ff4a7b2e3d6e84b8f2169e0b93078d",
      "text": "明明平时工作就那么忙，\n还特意准备了这样的礼物……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9a91dd475a8bc9c7b666448f4527a26e8ef7d76be3288e8f137fa9c36cd445d",
      "text": "光是这份心意我就超级开心了，\n居然还能拿到这么美味诱人的巧克力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88651179e3e4c8560efd5b972ea2a10240a2b4617348d7eb033b5212c1195ab8",
      "text": "吃掉感觉都有些舍不得呢……\n不过，我会好好品尝的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7eabe81b290819b238e4104d5b81e7e746046388262bd2b59812fb18d523233b",
      "text": "嘿嘿，白色情人节的回礼，\n还请好好期待着哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63161a507aadc629d32ea774c11cb75ec3c619bd710c5a5441e09e9d75977514",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n谢谢你的巧克力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cefdf13a1e0959f1cda0e103564c9fb7738c29b5ecf7cccc76e31d40b346c5d",
      "text": "没想到居然能从制作人那里收到……\n我，真的太开心了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6765ec5e08201a1e436745f3680a5842bf4e0869b837abc852f9b3c995f79b4c",
      "text": "而且，还特意等到了训练课进入休息时间对吧。\n谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c0b623fed9d68133c737bdbd19fbff39076cc91dbed10631eca820b486c8523",
      "text": "啊，对了。难得收到，\n这份巧克力，我现在可以吃吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:995b710db481c5d7a3ad8bd97fce8ed3964a98e499e81dfcba6479f233820439",
      "text": "因为闻起来又甜又好吃，\n我有点忍不住了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_b:cmd-000040:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aadd77fe93df0b276b9039d9de67449f166bf5d0e609612bd02e4568791fa806",
      "text": "当然可以。请慢用吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_b:cmd-000041:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00070f2c46b2b6c60018b02117039dd410c046d3fdb1ed28a4bd756b0746951e",
      "text": "好呀！可以的话也请告诉我感想哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ad5c694ddfc0d2bf1301b3f80e62dd9e6a133232955632f4122549184ae1e64",
      "text": "谢谢你！\n那么事不宜迟，我开动啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ad5c694ddfc0d2bf1301b3f80e62dd9e6a133232955632f4122549184ae1e64",
      "text": "谢谢你！\n那么事不宜迟，我开动啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8f00573634fb457320cc635c2818e4ef1e507d0e786d0ee28693cf79108f202",
      "text": "……好美味！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59e685c7c4b257455d90d68a06156ecb88139aa6e27c10a7b4e1f526f51d1b4b",
      "text": "这盒巧克力，跟蛋糕一样美味。\n能收到这么棒的东西……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_22:5_01_030_22_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1c1c2bef74b3d0a06f91a14e269c0b9febed060be76f0fcbf5357fb0af14d3b",
      "text": "这下，必须得鼓足干劲准备回礼了呢。\n白色情人节请好好期待着哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
